* Value in parenthesis indicates drivers in that hierarchy only.
** To conduct further analysis use the following commands:
set slrx_nets [get_nets -parent -hier -filter {CROSSING_SLRS!=""}]
set slrx_drv_pins [get_pins -filter {DIRECTION==OUT} -leaf -of $slrx_nets]
show_objects [get_cells <insert cell>/* -filter \{REF_NAME==<insert REF_NAME>} -of $slrx_drv_pins ]
Example:
show_objects [get_cells hierA/hierA1/* -filter {REF_NAME==FDRE} -of $slrx_drv_pins ]
Excluded 0 nets driven by internal signals for compile time reasons


